<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Someone &mdash; probably you &mdash; tried to create an account with this
address, but it already has one.</p>
<p><a href="<%= login_url %>">Sign in</a>, or
<a href="<%= reset_url %>">reset your password</a> if you no longer know it.</p>
<p>If this was not you, there is nothing to do: no account was created and
nothing changed.</p>
